<title>PERU: TABLE - Peru's Banco de Credito 6-mo net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peru's Banco de Credito 6-mo net up.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - 0.180 sol vs 0.161 sol</p>
<p>Net - 144.2 million soles vs 128.9 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 936.3 million soles vs 796.2 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Banco de Credito, Peru's leading bank, is 90.1 percent-owned by Credicorp Ltd.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
